r are identical) plus the usual libc/`libgcc` unwinder\nsymbols pulled in by the Rust standard library (`memcpy`, `malloc`, `abort`,\n`_Unwind_*`, `dl_iterate_phdr`, …).\n\nAll Rust undefined symbols are libc / libgcc-unwind symbols resolved by the\ndynamic loader. **0 undefined non-libc symbols.** ✅\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2182,"cache_read_input_tokens":27534,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2182,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"59686759-3b69-4d64-8093-1b824d251fd0","uuid":"ccd41c14-fe8c-4ea2-8fce-1a92d763f0c2","timestamp":"2026-08-28T16:37:39.155Z"}
